```mermaid
flowchart TD

A[Customer Contacts Customer Service] --> B{Warranty Valid?}

B -->|Yes| C[Schedule On-Site Intervention]

B -->|No| D[Daorung Creates Estimate]
D --> E[Estimate Includes:<br/>Spare Parts<br/>Transportation<br/>Labor]
E --> F[Customer Approves Estimate<br/>No Payment Required]

C --> G[Acteon Technician Goes On Site]
F --> G

G --> H[Repair Performed]

H --> I{Free of Charge?}

I -->|Yes| J[Leave Service Memo]
J --> K[Customer Signs Service Memo]
K --> N[Collect Signed Service Memo]

I -->|No| L[Record Actual Spare Parts Used]
L --> M[Example: W090800022]
M --> K

N --> O[Technician Returns to Company]

O --> P[Create Invoice in WinSpeed]

P --> Q[Add Invoice Number to Service Memo]

Q --> R[Close Service Request]

classDef warranty fill:#d5f5d5,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#000;
classDef estimate fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#ff9800,color:#000;
classDef invoice fill:#d6eaf8,stroke:#3498db,color:#000;

class C warranty;
class D,E,F estimate;
class P,Q invoice;
